  description: 'The first time this Special Summoned card would be destroyed by battle
    each turn, it is not destroyed. Once per turn, during your opponent''s End Phase:
    You can target 1 Level 3 or lower "Performapal" monster in your Graveyard; send
    this card to the Graveyard, and if you do, add that monster to your hand. If
    a "Performapal" monster is sent from the hand to your Graveyard (except during
    the Damage Step), while this card is in your Graveyard: You can Special Summon
    this card. You can only use this effect of "Performapal Teeter Totter Hopper"
    once per turn.'
